    <published>2026-02-07T09:02:07.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-02-08T03:59:43.481Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="\assets\css\APlayer.min.css"><script src="\assets\js\APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><html><head></head><body><span id="more"></span><meting-js server="netease" type="song" id="3340112781" mode="circulation" autoplay="true" mutex="false" listmaxheight="340px" preload="auto" theme="#ad7a86"></meting-js><h1><span id="%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%B9%E9%85%8D%E5%B8%83">均为个人自建模型，免费配布</span></h1><h2><span id="%E5%A6%82%E6%82%A8%E5%B7%B2%E6%82%89%E7%9F%A5%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E5%88%99%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%A5%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B">如您已悉知以下规则，则可以使用该模型</span></h2><h1><span id="1%E5%8F%AA%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E6%94%B9%E9%80%A0%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E9%AA%A8%E9%AA%BC%E5%92%8C%E5%88%9A%E4%BD%93%E9%87%8D%E5%88%B6uv">1.只允许改造，优化骨骼和刚体，重制UV</span></h1><h1><span id="2%E8%AF%B7%E5%8B%BF%E4%BA%8C%E9%85%8D">2.请勿二配</span></h1><h1><span id="3%E8%AF%B7%E5%8B%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E7%9A%8418%E7%A6%81%E6%9E%81%E7%AB%AF%E5%AE%97%E6%95%99%E5%AE%A3%E4%BC%A0">3.请勿用于公开性质的18禁，极端宗教宣传</span></h1><h1><span id="4%E8%AF%B7%E5%8B%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E7%94%A8%E9%80%94">4.请勿用于商业用途</span></h1><h1><span id="5%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87%E7%94%B1%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%80%85%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB">5.一切由使用者造成的任何权利纠纷，模型编辑者不承担任何责任</span></h1><ol><li><p><a href="https://www.123684.com/s/dzOqVv-eYrbv">石中剑模型下载链接</a><br><img src="/images/%E7%9F%B3%E4%B8%AD%E5%89%91%E6%BC%94%E7%A4%BA%E5%9B%BE.png" alt="石中剑演示图"></p></li><li><p><a href="">军用匕首模型</a><br><img src="/images/%E5%86%9B%E7%94%A8%E5%8C%95%E9%A6%96%E6%BC%94%E7%A4%BA%E5%9B%BE.png" alt="军用匕首演示图"></p></li></ol></body></html>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
        
        
